From: Folia Compatibility Patch
Subject: [PATCH] LavaWalkerEffect: Replace Bukkit.getScheduler().runTaskLater with native Folia schedulers

AE PATCH REASON: Bukkit.getScheduler().runTaskLater makes code incompatible with Folia region-threaded architecture and crashes at runtime (UnsupportedOperationException from stripped SchedulerUtils or direct Bukkit.getScheduler() call rejected by Folia).
AE PATCH FIX: Replace Bukkit.getScheduler().runTaskLater and cancelTask with native Folia Bukkit.getRegionScheduler().runDelayed. Remove dead removalTasks/clearQueue code. Replace HashMap with ConcurrentHashMap. Rename obfuscated vars.
AE PATCH RISK: LOW - MIGRATE: Bukkit scheduler → RegionScheduler. DROP: dead code. THREAD: ConcurrentHashMap. RF: var rename. No behavior change.

